{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 19:46:17.197380", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Assessment:\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with one central switch and multiple edge switches. Hosts are connected to edge switches, and all devices share a single access subnet (10.0.0.0/24). The SDN controller is located at 20.0.0.100, managing the switches via OpenFlow.\\n\\nBased on the reachability test results, the network exhibits the following behavior:\\n1. **Normal Connectivity**: Most hosts can successfully communicate with each other, with no packet loss and reasonable round-trip times (RTTs).\\n2. **Anomalous Behavior**: Host_2 is unable to communicate with Host_4 and Host_1. The status for these tests is marked as \"unknown,\" indicating a potential issue with Host_2 or its associated edge switch (Switch_2).\\n\\n#### Detailed Findings:\\n1. **Successful Communication**:\\n   - Hosts such as Host_1, Host_3, Host_4, Host_5, Host_6, Host_7, and Host_8 can communicate with each other without any packet loss.\\n   - RTTs for successful communications range between approximately 43 ms to 47 ms, which is within acceptable limits for the network.\\n\\n2. **Host_2 Anomaly**:\\n   - Host_2 failed to establish communication with Host_4 and Host_1. The test results for these connections show no transmitted or received packets, and all metrics (RTT, loss percentage, etc.) are null.\\n   - This suggests a potential issue with Host_2\\'s network configuration, its connection to Switch_2, or Switch_2\\'s connectivity to the central switch (Switch_0).\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the root cause of Host_2\\'s connectivity issues. This may involve:\\n- Verifying Host_2\\'s network configuration and interface status.\\n- Checking the operational status and configuration of Switch_2.\\n- Examining the connection between Switch_2 and the central switch (Switch_0).\\n\\nThis concludes the initial diagnostic report., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='6cf09c5e-656f-43cd-a642-9de40d4a10f8'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
